    "physicalNotes": [
      "Place U1 across the center trench with the pin-1 mark to the left. Leave F12–J12, A15–E15 and A12–E12 isolated for unused terminals 1, 5 and 8.",
      "Use a regulated, current-limited 5 V source. Keep C1 near the comparator supply connections.",
      "Keep the indicator LED from shining on the photocell. The sensor model uses nominal light/dark endpoints, not a calibrated lux response."
